  "review_observations": [
    "New green eye, face, tabby fur pattern, white chest and raised tail remain coherent and attractive at native and integer scale.",
    "Near hind paw reaches forward under the belly, supports while moving back, then lifts and recovers. Near fore paw has a complementary visible reach/recovery and backstroke.",
    "Actual native layer diagnostics retain four separately traceable limbs; all eight poses have three paws at their side-specific planted baseline. Far-side feet use107 and near-side109 screen-y for perspective depth, not one shared screen line.",
    "All eight native frames and actual-layer diagnostic silhouettes were inspected in sequence, including0→1,3→4 and7→0. The earlier root compression seam and disconnected whisker dots were repaired in the editable source.",
